  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "18",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;and using vector triple product, we have,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Similarly,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Thus,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p>"
  }
